201. FIG. 3 illustrates a flowchart of a method for symbolic reasoning
     with resonance in the LLMs consistent with the present disclosure.

202. Referring to FIG. 3, the method 300 may include one or more of the
     steps described below. FIG. 3 illustrates a flow chart of an
     example method executed by the SR node 102 (see FIG. 2). It should
