     syllabic languages, decomposition may follow rhythmic morae. These
     variations are illustrative and do not limit the scope of the
     present disclosure, which applies generally to syllabic
     decomposition, Vritti association, and ontology mapping regardless
     of language family, and extends to governance frameworks
     incorporating domain entropy gating and Kosha readiness gating, as
